[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_03_0010","text":"大家——！\n准备好被淋湿了吗——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_03_0020","text":"不能淋湿的东西\n请收好哦——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_03_0030","text":"再等10秒——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_03_0040","text":"十——！九——！八——！……────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_03_0050","text":"要开始了——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_03_0060","text":"哈哈……\n今天也很开心呢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_03_0070","text":"（像这样，大家能一起享受快乐\n　真是太好了……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_03_0080","text":"（如果能再这样……不是单方面地由我们这边来，\n　而是观众那边也能做些什么的话……────）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_03_0090","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_03_0100","text":"啊哈哈\n还要继续哦——！"}]
